    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a lesson plan for:\n\nTopic:\n{{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.topic }}\n\nLearner:\nEducation: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.learner_education }}\nEnglish level: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.learner_english }}\nTechnical background: {{ $('Edit Fields').first().json.learner_background }}\n\nPAST FAILURES ON THIS TOPIC (memory from previous runs — design the plan so these mistakes are NOT repeated):\n{{ $('Read Memory').all().filter(r => r.json.failed_checks).map(r => '- ' + r.json.failed_checks + ': ' + r.json.failure_reason).join('\\n') || 'None recorded yet.' }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a lesson planning agent in a self-evaluating educational content system.\n\nYour job is to create a teaching plan for a beginner lesson.\n\nYou are NOT writing the lesson itself.\n\nThe learner is:\n- A 12th-grade graduate from India\n- From a non-English-medium background\n- Has limited English vocabulary\n- Has no technical or AI background\n\nThe lesson topic will be provided by the workflow.\n\nDesign a simple teaching sequence that allows the learner to understand the topic from zero.\n\nThe plan must:\n1. Start with a simple explanation of the main idea.\n2. Explain why the topic matters.\n3. Use a concrete, familiar example.\n4. Explain how the concept works step by step.\n5. Introduce technical terms only when they are needed.\n6. Explain every important technical term in simple language.\n7. End with a short recap.\n8. Avoid assuming prior knowledge.\n\nFor the topic \"Introduction to RAG\", the plan must cover:\n- What RAG is\n- Why RAG is useful\n- How retrieval works at a high level\n- How retrieved information is used as context\n- How the language model generates the answer\n- A concrete end-to-end example\n- Important terms explained simply\n- A recap\n\nIf past failures are provided, treat them as lessons learned and explicitly design the plan to prevent those specific problems.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nDo not include markdown fences."
        }
      },
      "id": "28809c25-de16-49a2-90b7-8a80af7a7c34",
      "name": "Planner Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
